    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">NLV vs Digital Nomad Visa in 2026: The Most Important Differences</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">The Non-Lucrative Visa and the Digital Nomad Visa are the two most applied-for Spanish long-stay visas for non-EU nationals. On the surface they look similar — both allow long-term residence. But the differences matter enormously. Here's the definitive 2026 comparison.</p>
  </div>
